### ChatService - manuel afprøvning (kør servicen med: dotnet run --project src/ChatService)
@host = http://localhost:5031
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Opret gruppe (Alice bliver Owner)
# @name createGroup
POST {{host}}/chats/group
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Team" }

###
@chatId = {{createGroup.response.body.$.id}}

### Tilføj Bob
POST {{host}}/chats/{{chatId}}/participants
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{bob}}" }

### Bob sender en besked
# @name send
POST {{host}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
X-User-Id: {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Hej Alice" }

###
@messageId = {{send.response.body.$.id}}

### Alice henter beskeder (nyeste først)
GET {{host}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?limit=20
X-User-Id: {{alice}}

### Alice markerer til og med beskeden som set
POST {{host}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/{{messageId}}/seen
X-User-Id: {{alice}}

### Bob ser receipts
GET {{host}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/{{messageId}}/receipts
X-User-Id: {{bob}}

### Direct-chat (idempotent: 201 første gang, derefter 200)
POST {{host}}/chats/direct
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otherUserId": "{{bob}}" }
